WEBVTT

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:04.090
Thank you very much!

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.060
It's almost tournament time.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.980
I-I'm starting to feel nervous...

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.290
It's too soon for nerves.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.270
Right now, we need to make sure
we're ready for it.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.120
We haven't trained nearly enough.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.290
Y'know, I found out Seijo's doing a training
camp to get ready for the tournament.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.080
A training camp, huh?

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.370
That's it!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.100
We'll have a training camp to build 
ourselves up for the tournament, too!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>Having Each Others' Backs, and Having Fun</b>

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:14.230
<i>This place has a real nice feel to it.</i>

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:19.590
<i>Today, our baseball training
camp adventure begins.</i>

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.820
<i>Nakano-san, turn it off for a second.</i>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.070
<i>Say what?</i>

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.810
<i>Turn the camera off.</i>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.630
<i>But I was gonna keep a video diary
of our training camp...</i>

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.500
<i>We need to greet our host first.</i>

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.130
This is where you come to practice?

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:37.140
Yeah. Apparently,
the head priest likes baseball,

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.260
so he lets us practice here.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:40.970
What's that?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.220
A specially designed practice
regimen for our training camp.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.220
<b>Training Camp Practice Regimen</b>

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:58.190
Oh, hello! Thank you for always 
letting me and my friend practice here.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:01.200
We're the Satogahama High 
School girls' baseball team.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.030
We'll be training here this week.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.180
Thank you for having us!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.210
I'll be cheering you on myself.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.540
That was a lovely greeting, girls.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.750
Yes, I could hear you
loud and clear from inside.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.380
Hello!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.590
We're so glad you're here.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.920
I'm Kakehashi. We spoke on the phone.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.430
Thank you for letting us 
stay here for the week.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.840
<i>Please, come right this way.</i>

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.410
<i>Feel free to use the baseball equipment
in the back if you need it.</i>

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.390
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.690
Well, that just about covers it.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:53.870
Make sure you cook and bathe
in a timely fashion.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.870
<b>Wake up at 4:00!
</b>Jogging — 1 hour<b>
</b>Stretches to avoid injury
Weightlifting, sprints<b>
Breakfast — 7:30
Morning Practice:
</b>Catch, basic training<b>
Lunch — 12:00
Afternoon Practice:
</b>Full team (+ individual)<b>
</b>Special fielding practice<b>
Dinner — 6:00
Sleep at 9:00!
</b>Shadow swings<b></b>

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.870
<b>Cleaning

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.870
<b>Rotation</b>

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.870
<b>Kawakita 
Nozaki 
Suzuki 
Arihara 
Shinonome 
Tsukumo 
Iwaki 
Asada 
Kurashiki 
Nakano 
Ukita

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.580
Okay!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:02.200
Also, I'd like us to define
our goals for this training camp.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.590
To improve our baseball skills, of course.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.980
And to help us all become
better friends too, right?

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.400
This is a pre-tournament training camp.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.710
We need to focus on our skills.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.860
But isn't teamwork also important?

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.860
I think both of those things
can be your goals.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.670
Improve
Friendships

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.670
Improve
at Baseball

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.820
Does this work for you, Captain Arihara?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.910
Huh?

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:29.830
Is there a problem?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.700
Um... I'm the captain?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.820
Aren't you?

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.210
I assumed you were.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.050
Yeah!

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:38.410
Who else could do it but you?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.370
Captain!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.270
What do you say, Arihara-san?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.140
All right! I'll do my best!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.160
We're counting on you!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.380
Go, Tsubasa!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.290
This is exciting, isn't it?

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.520
I'm kind of excited, too... I think.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.730
You won't be feeling that way for long.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:02.890
Huh?

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.110
One more!

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:12.620
Second!

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.410
I got it!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.250
Nice one, Tomocchi!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.570
Eyes forward!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.550
Third!

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.930
Sorry!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.650
Okay, we're starting over!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.080
That's the fifth do-over...

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:49.910
This "no-error" fielding practice is
seriously a training routine from hell.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.690
Great effort, everyone!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:05.760
No, we're still nowhere near good 
enough to play in a tournament.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.090
She's a demon.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.050
We have an actual demon among us.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.510
I can be even meaner if I have to.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.210
Hey, could you look this way
and say that one more time?

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.270
No, I can't!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.410
Back to practice!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.590
It looks delicious!

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.320
I can't wait to dig in!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.780
Okay, that should do it.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.730
That's my Tomocchi!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.540
This chicken and egg
over rice looks yummy!

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:41.080
Kawakita-san, thanks for 
making dinner for everyone.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.040
All right, girls, let's dig in.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.510
Let's eat!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.210
Do it like you're throwing a ball.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.360
Like that.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.820
Nozaki-san, a moment.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.070
Yes?

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.870
Why don't you give this a try?

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.130
Like... this?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.300
With a bit of practice,
I think you could be a pitcher.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:34.500
Huh?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.640
It would be great to have 
a left-handed pitcher.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.380
Me? No, I couldn't...

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:44.100
If I ended up hitting someone, I'd feel awful.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.220
Oh...

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.060
That's a shame.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.530
I'm sorry.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.100
I can't seem to get the timing right at all.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:54.390
Yeah.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:57.290
Why don't you try striking this?

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.470
The wooden block?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.630
Like this, you mean?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.590
Yeah! That's the beat!

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.560
That feels right... I think!

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.780
Nakano-san, what are you doing?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.180
Oh, this?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.660
Having a beat makes it easier to time a swing.

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:42.870
Using that?

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.600
A hot bath sure feels good.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.630
My whole body hurts, though.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:58.140
Mine, too. I can't raise my arms.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.610
If that session was enough to make you sore,

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:02.850
we're in for a rough—

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.760
Wow! Would ya look at these guns?!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:05.490
Wha—

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.110
I can tell you do a lot of training!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.110
Hey!

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.190
S-Stop that!

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:13.700
Six more days...
We'll have to work really hard...

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:17.970
All right! This will chase 
away your exhaustion!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:24.870
Hurrah! Hurrah! Sato High!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.050
Hurrah! Hurrah! Sato High!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:29.330
Stop it with the cheering!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.330
Hurrah! Hurrah! Sato High!

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.350
Ta-da!

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.460
How about we all play this?

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.030
See? It's one of our goals 
for this training camp!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:42.430
Improve
at Baseball

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:44.890
Improve
Friendships

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:42.740
Y-Yes, but we're a bit tired now...

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:42.560
Improve
at Baseball

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.890
Improve
at Baseball

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:44.890
Come on, let's play! Whaddaya say?

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.810
She's a demon, too...

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.830
Let's play.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.290
Kitty Ball!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.260
You're using too many 
vanishing miracle pitches.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.820
We agreed on no more than
three pitches per innings.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.030
Just one more! Kitty Ball!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:57.990
There.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.910
One more time!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.000
You've won every game. Isn't that enough?

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.370
Would you girls please just go to sleep?

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:11.340
Just a little bit longer!

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:15.370
Eep!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.760
You'll find practice difficult tomorrow.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.910
See? We should go to sleep.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.290
I guess so.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:39.490
Good morning!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.820
Watch out for traffic!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.300
It's still dark...

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.330
It almost looks like an ascetic ritual now.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.590
How many days has it been again?

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.960
We have, uh... two days left!

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.540
We're only here for morning 
practice on the last day,

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.310
so more specifically, we have
one day and twelve hours left.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.230
The ballpark figure was fine...

00:11:56.230 --> 00:12:01.190
I'd really like to get through our final
fielding practice with no misses.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.430
We can do that!

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:10.010
Uh, I mean... I hope we can...

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:11.870
I agree.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:12.780
Yeah.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.920
Well, we'll just have to 
pounce on every single ball!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.550
Yeah!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:25.170
So... it begins again today, does it?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.530
We're going to do it on the first try today.

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.010
Yeah!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:38.650
Next!

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.490
Keep it up, everyone!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.950
Next! Last hit!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.630
Great.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.970
Nice catching, everyone!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.440
The head priest...

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.420
Sunflowers?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.250
You can tell a lot of care
went into this meal.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.960
Now that's what I call photogenic!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.920
Wow! They look like bats!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:48.430
It's a special dinner for our 
last night of training camp.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.410
Thank you, Nozaki-san.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.000
Well, shall we?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.890
Let's eat!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.390
Eat up, girls!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.790
I can't tell if it's sweet or spicy...

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.780
It's, um, I mean...

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.490
It all tastes terrible.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.890
<b>Straight down Main Street!?</b>

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.710
What did you put in this?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:21.780
Um... I didn't want to make it too spicy
just in case anyone didn't like spicy stuff,

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:24.050
so I added sugar...

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:28.920
And milk to make it milder,
mint to make it refreshing,

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:33.560
and for that ethnic touch, cilantro...
all ground up in equal amounts.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.020
Then, to add nutritional value...

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.520
We've heard enough, Nozaki-san.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.960
Mint and cilantro. That's why 
I couldn't make sense of the smell.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.910
You're still eating it, 
though, Shinonome-san.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.530
Only to make sure I keep my strength up.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.820
Well, I think it works pretty we—

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:55.960
I'm so very sorry.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.930
Hey, this is really good!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.660
Y-You mean it?

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.300
Yeah! What is it, anyway?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:05.340
Um... It's curry rice...

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.740
Oh! Okay!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.260
Wow, I'm impressed!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.080
This is all training.

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:13.650
Really?

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.720
I just needed to get used to it.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.590
There's something missing...

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:27.650
Maybe it's that thing the
head priest taught us to use?

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.410
Yeah! That's exactly what I need!

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.150
I sure am grateful for
the head priest's teachings.

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:37.620
Um... Who's this "head priest"
you're talking about?

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:38.910
Huh?

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.080
Well, you mentioned a head priest...

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.160
The head priest is... well, the head priest.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.490
Of this temple?

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:48.470
Yeah. We greeted him on 
the first day, remember?

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.730
Come on, you saw him, didn't you?

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.300
No, I didn't...

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:57.490
He was there when we were 
doing our practice swings, too.

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.140
I didn't notice him.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.770
Of course he was there!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.340
He's short, and he's always smiling.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.900
Jeez, come on now!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:06.490
What's the matter?

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.500
Shinonome-san is saying weird things.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.800
Nakano-san, could we take a look at that?

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:18.990
Huh?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.810
He should be in this video.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:25.920
Um... Huh?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.380
What?

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:29.260
Why...

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:31.190
Wh-What's going on here?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:35.350
There, you see? No head priest
anywhere to be found.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.910
<i>You'll find practice difficult tomorrow.</i>

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:51.980
All I wanted was for our last
dinner here to be enjoyable...

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.110
Huh? Did the power go out?

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:07.890
Head priest?

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.220
Now, you mustn't sigh.

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:13.170
I'm sorry. It slipped out.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.340
There's no need to apologize.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:21.110
I keep... causing problems for everyone else.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.980
I'm just... so hopeless.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.990
You're being awfully hard on yourself.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:29.990
Come, join me over here.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:42.350
Your friend suggested that
you try pitching, correct?

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:43.310
Yes...

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.210
There's nothing wrong with 
being concerned about others,

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.250
and not wanting to hit 
anyone with your pitches.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.430
But you shouldn't take it to extremes.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.030
But I don't think I can...

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.310
Here. Try throwing it.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.520
B-But...

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:09.980
It'll be all right. Come now.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:14.280
But if I hit you, it'll hurt a lot.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.430
Just pretend I'm a ghost.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:21.120
Then you can throw it without 
a care in the world, right?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.300
A ghost?

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.290
Yes, that's it!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:35.690
Keep smiling like that, and relax a bit more.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:39.470
The most important thing in 
life and baseball is to have fun.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.140
To have fun?

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.170
Huh?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.340
Head... priest?

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.010
Why won't the lights come on?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.810
Everyone...

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:53.520
H-Hurrah! Sato High!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.960
Iwaki-senpai, p-please calm down!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.300
Where is everyone?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.760
Keep away!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.300
Girls?

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:08.980
What's wrong?

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.860
I told you! There never 
was any head priest here.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.720
But there totally was!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.400
He was this really sweet old man.

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.840
I didn't see him, either...

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:26.490
What's more, the priest here
is only about 30 years old.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.740
Maybe you were all just seeing things.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.370
No way! I-It was...

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.470
It must have been a ghost!

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:42.420
Did the head priest's ghost...
show up to try to... scare us?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.790
That didn't seem to be his intention...

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:49.140
He was always smiling,
so I don't think he was evil or anything.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.540
Yuuki-chan!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.990
Why don't you take a shot at pitching?

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.200
Okay!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:14.950
It'll be fine.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.880
Yes! Nice pitching!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.930
When did you start practicing?

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:31.010
That's... a secret!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.480
All right! Give me one more!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:40.400
It's here again, Father...

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:43.650
Your favorite time of the year.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:55.830
Okay! We're done with fielding practice!

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:00.020
Good job, everyone!

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.170
Huh? Who's that?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Wings on Your Back</b>
